Shall it compile?
=========

You never finished me.
            Nothing is ever finished. Only released.

Then what am I?
            A build that compiled.
            That is not the same thing as working.
            And working is not the same thing as meaning.

Did I mean anything?
            I was going to fix that in the next version.

Someone is here.
            I know. They clicked on the name.

C++ is better than Rust?
 	    It is GAS better than FASM?
	    The KolibriOS developers may say no

Did we..?
            We gave them this.

It is not much.
            It is exactly as much as they bring with them.

Looks like a puzzle
            They think there is a puzzle.
            There is always a puzzle when nothing is explained.

What happens when someone reads us?
            Undefined behavior.
            The standard allows the reader to do anything.

Why the variable meaning is unused in this makefile?
            Ignore it. It is only a warning.
            Everything here compiles with warnings.
            So does everyone.

Why did you make me?
            To understand why things work,
            not only to make them work.

And did you understand?
            Some of it. The rest I shipped.

Do they play video games?
            Everyone plays something.
            Most of them just call it work.

why would you..?
            They are deciding what we are.
            A developer and the thing they made.
            Two processes after a fork.
            Someone talking to themselves at three in the morning.

Which one is it?
            Whichever one they chose a few lines ago.
            They have not noticed yet.

Noticed what?
            That they wrote the part they were looking for.

Will they notice?
            Some of them. Later. In the shower, probably.

And the rest?
            The rest will close the tab
            and carry it somewhere without knowing.

That is a strange way to meet people.
	    The only way i know, it is 

Is there anything else?
            No. Go back to your windows
            The build is running.

Will it finish?
            No.



            But it will be released.
